<view class="page payment-page">
  <view class="payment-state state-{{paymentState}}">
    <view class="state-symbol">{{paymentState === 'success' ? '✓' : paymentState === 'error' ? '!' : paymentState === 'cancelled' ? '—' : '·'}}</view>
    <view class="state-title">{{stateTitle}}</view>
    <view class="state-message">{{stateMessage}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{view}}" class="card order-summary">
    <view class="summary-title">{{view.serviceName}}</view>
    <view class="summary-row"><text>服务对象</text><text>{{view.companionName}}</text></view>
    <view class="summary-row"><text>预约时间</text><text>{{view.scheduleText}}（北京时间）</text></view>
    <view class="summary-row"><text>服务时长</text><text>{{view.durationText}}</text></view>
    <view class="summary-row total"><text>支付金额</text><text>{{view.amountText}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{paymentState === 'ready'}}" class="card rules-card">
    <view class="rules-title">付款前请确认</view>
    <view class="rule">• 付款通过微信支付完成，平台不会要求私下转账。</view>
    <view class="rule">• 服务未开始时可申请原路退款；服务中或服务完成后的申请进入人工审核。</view>
    <view class="rule policy-rule">• 本单服务完成后 {{view.refundRequestWindowHours}} 小时内可自助提交退款申请；超过该期限仍可联系平台客服提交履约、合规或法定权利争议。</view>
    <view class="policy-version">本单退款规则版本 {{view.refundPolicyVersion}} · 小时数与版本已固定，之后的新规则不会缩短本单期限。</view>
    <button class="policy-link" bindtap="openRefundTerms">查看用户协议与完整退款条款</button>
    <view class="rule">• 微信受理后仍需等待服务端确认；不要因页面未及时变化而重复付款。</view>
    <button class="terms-check {{termsConfirmed ? 'checked' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleTerms">{{termsConfirmed ? '✓' : '○'}} 我已核对金额、服务、{{view.refundRequestWindowHours}} 小时退款窗口与规则版本</button>
    <button class="primary-button pay-button" disabled="{{!termsConfirmed}}" bindtap="pay">确认并调起微信支付</button>
  </view>

  <button wx:if="{{paymentState === 'pending' || paymentState === 'cancelled' || paymentState === 'error'}}" class="primary-button full-button" bindtap="queryResult">查询支付结果（不会扣款）</button>
  <button wx:if="{{paymentState === 'success' || paymentState === 'unavailable'}}" class="primary-button full-button" bindtap="openOrderDetail">返回订单详情</button>
  <button wx:if="{{paymentState !== 'loading' && paymentState !== 'processing'}}" class="support-button full-button" bindtap="openPaymentSupport">支付结果需要平台核对</button>

  <view class="authority-note">本页只展示服务端查询到的订单状态。微信支付受理、客户端成功回调和最终入账是三个不同阶段。</view>
</view>
